    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed rear dormer extension by reason of its size, massing and bulk would create unsympathetic form of development which does not respect the character of the property due to its lack of set-ins or set-downs from the roof ridge and side boundaries, and therefore the development would appear insubordinate and harmful to the character of the property, and character of the terraces in this locality. The proposal is contrary to Policy 53 of Waltham Forests LP1 (2024) and Waltham Forests Residential Alterations and Retrofit SPD (2026).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
